Package: dialogforgeinspect
Type: Package
Title: Non-Evaluating Binding Inspection for DialogForge
Version: 0.4.3
Authors@R: person("Adrian", "Dusa", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
    email = "dusa.adrian@unibuc.ro")
Description: Reads binding state and delayed lookup provenance without
    evaluating promises or invoking active bindings, and observes physical
    graphics device closure without invoking R callbacks. Internal runtime support
    for the DialogForge application, shared by native R and WebAssembly R.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.5.0)
NeedsCompilation: yes
